# realworld-web

This repo is the gothinkster React RealWorld SPA (pinned SHA). It is **not** Next.js.

- Do not apply `nextjs-bff-rules`.
- Talk to the local API at `http://localhost:3100/api`.
- Product compose lives in `realworld-local`; do not start a second Postgres.
